  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **In Case You Change Your Mind** (1 other source): Played in the second set, segueing into a song titled Stuck Inside of Mobile [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Holow Heart**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Dealing Dispair**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Cattle In the Cane**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Paddy's On the Turnpike**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **In Case You Change Your Mind**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Alabama Bound**: back after 174 archived shows (1178 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Doin My Time**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-04-15.flynn** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 159 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-04-15.flynn**: taped by Flynn; transferred by Flynn; source: (FOB) Schoeps MSTC64Ug > Soyuz LD(sat) > MP6ii @ 32 Bit Float [1]. Also: Recorded and transferred by Flynn, taping front of board with Schoeps MSTC64Ug microphones; Signal chain ran through a Soyuz LD preamp into an MP6ii recorder at 32 bit float, delivered as a 24 bit file set [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-04-15 Mobile Civic Center Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-04-15-mobile-civic-center-regular/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-04-15 Mobile Civic AP Color Variant Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-04-15-mobile-civic-ap-color-variant-reg/) [4]\n- Poster by @author_handle: [BILLY STRINGS](https://www.mobilecountyal.gov/community_events/events/billy-strings-2023-04-14) [5]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Mobile Civic Center Arena Alabama April 15th 2023 poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-mobile-civic-center-arena-alabama-april-15th-2023-poster) [6]\n- Fan art by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Mobile Civic Center Arena Alabama April 15th 2023 poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-mobile-civic-center-arena-alabama-april-15th-2023-poster) [7]",
